    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>Effective Date: February 2026</p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      Watchfolio is a private journal application for watch collectors.
      The app does not collect personal information and does not transmit
      user data to external servers.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Storage</h2>
    <p>
      All collection data, including photos, notes, and watch details,
      is stored locally on your device unless you choose to share content
      manually using your device’s built-in sharing features.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      Watchfolio does not use advertising networks, analytics services,
      tracking technologies, or third-party data collection tools.
    </p>

